  "description": "Quinn Property Management are pleased to bring to the market this beautifully renovated 3 bedroom 2 bath mid terrace house. \n\nThe property has been recently been renovated from top to bottom with all new windows and doors and has been fitted with an air-to water system that is ideal for those looking for an efficiently run home. This property features a bright and spacious living area, a modern fitted kitchen with ample dining space, and three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite bathroom.\n\nThe home benefits from a main bathroom, generous storage throughout, and a private outdoor space ideal for relaxing or entertaining. Located in a peaceful residential setting, the property is within walking distance of local amenities, including shops, schools, and community facilities, while also offering easy access to Ennis, Shannon, and the M18 motorway.\n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended. * We are requesting expressions of interest by emaiI only. To register your interest in this property, please fill your details in to the Contact Seller box on the right of this ad in order to receive an application form. * Disclaimer: Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intending lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of information given.\n\n",
